--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ADR / SPEC CONFORMANCE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ADR-002  : view performs no HTTP; both view-models drive the data seams.
ADR-004  : binds the shared KMP core (NotificationsRepository, ApiHttpClient,
           SettingsStore) — no app-side networking or business logic added.
ADR-005  : design tokens only (Spacing, MaterialTheme.colorScheme); no hardcoded
           colors/typography (PageTitle / BodyText / IconButton from the A3 library).
ADR-006  : both surfaces reused verbatim; zero re-implementation.
ADR-011  : no placeholders / stubs (placeholder gate PLACEHOLDER_COUNT=0).
ADR-013  : cache-then-network freshness preserved end to end by the embedded panel.
ADR-014  : every visible literal via stringResource; web key names preserved.
ADR-015  : dynamic-color + dark-theme inherited from the A2 theme; semantics +
           >=48dp targets from the A3 components; propose-only seed contract honored.
Compose-native only — no webview cloning.

